{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/1422170-trinity-core-a-grenade-cheaper-than-a-knife","id":1422170,"title":"Trinity Core a grenade cheaper than a knife?","path":["Home","Onyx Path","Onyx Path Worlds","The Trinity Continuum"],"posts":[{"date":"2020-11-05T19:34:24-08:00","id":1422170,"title":"Trinity Core a grenade cheaper than a knife?","content":"Just re reading trinity core, and I stumbled on this strange fact in the weapons chapter, a weapon gets a free tag plus one tag for wealth point, so a grenade \u201ccost\u201d one wealth while a simple knife three wealth points. Should just arbitrarily change the weapon cost to be more realistic or I am missing something?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5811-starkiller","name":"Starkiller","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"47"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-11-05T22:51:13-08:00","id":1422181,"title":"","content":"The weapon cost rules are pretty weird in general.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1711-zeea","name":"Zeea","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"106"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-11-05T23:31:33-08:00","id":1422185,"title":"","content":"You can change the weapon so the cost is on what you expect.<br /> <br /> To the grenade for example you can add a tag or 2, and to the knife remove a tag or 2.<br /> <br /> Grenade: Explosive (thrown), Agravated, Brutal (2+2+1)<br /> Knife: Thrown, Concealable, Grapple, Melee. (1+1*+1+0)<br /> <br /> * Concealable cost is 1, not 2, at least should be.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/481584/house-rules-bundle-bundle\" target=\"_blank\">House Rules - The Bundle</a> - House Rules for Everyone<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/481581/powered-inspiration-bundle\" target=\"_blank\">Powered Inspired</a> - Powered Characters using Inspiration and Gifts<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/product/413362/Fists-and-Tomes-BUNDLE\" target=\"_blank\">Fists and Tomes</a> - Inspired Martial Arts and Mysticism for Talents<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/492147/supertech\" target=\"_blank\">Supertech</a> - Super Science in the hands of Talents","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24985-mateus-luz","name":"Mateus Luz","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24985_3.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2950"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-11-06T00:48:08-08:00","id":1422193,"title":"","content":"While there's some odd price choices (I'd say Concealable should be variable at least, since hiding larger weapons makes more sense at 2), I think it's more that the example grenade is less a grenade and more a powerful fire-cracker when you consider how far from a modern military grenade it is (Aggravated, Brutal, Deadly, and Piercing are all things you'd expect to see... possibly Spread for fragmentation grenades as well).<br /> <br /> That said, TC isn't really about realism over action genre conventions.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/617-heavy-arms","name":"Heavy Arms","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar617_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"12634"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-11-06T05:36:48-08:00","id":1422226,"title":"","content":"I read is as a simple hand granade - and these things are actually not expensive (in the european black market a simple granade is 10-15 \u20ac and a Kalshnikov about 350, so you can get 4 assault rifles for the price of a new iphone - if you know the right guy). Also a combat knife is actually pricier than a grenade, but normally it\u00b4s not a military weapon.<br /> The problem is access - in storypath terms - yes you can maybe easily pay for it, but you need access to a seller. (That\u00b4s why i will personally connect wealth to paths.)","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Gamelines: Requiem, Lost, Awakening, Trinity Continuum: Aeon, some V5.<br /> Likes cheesecake (quark-based)","edited":{"userid":1305,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1305-maekkel","user":"maekkel","date":". 11-06-2020, 08:38 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1305-maekkel","name":"maekkel","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1305_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"206"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-11-06T06:01:40-08:00","id":1422231,"title":"","content":"That\u2019s why I houserule Wealth caps on 3 dots and Loaded adds 2 to that. The remaining value must come from a relevant path. Basically you buy things related to the path using path dots instead of wealth, while wealth stack with it. For example, a grenade is not expensive, but you need to know the guy (having a few dots in the proper path) or be specially rich to buy it from a legal source.<br /> <br /> more details on<br /> <div class=\"b-bbcode b-bbcode__url b-bbcode__url--preview\"> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/1408953-equipment-house-rules\" class=\"urlimg_container\"> <img class=\"js-img-fallback\" src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/filedata/fetch?filedataid=1074\"> </a> <div class=\"urlinfo\"> <div class=\"title ellipsis\"> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/1408953-equipment-house-rules\"> Equipment House rules - Onyx Path Forums </a> </div> <div class=\"url ellipsis\"> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/1408953-equipment-house-rules\"> http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/1408953-equipment-house-rules </a> </div> <div class=\"meta\"> Wealth and Costs Wealth take the importance of paths away, by removing the link between the path and available equipment to the character. To avoid this, the Wealth edge and the cost system must change. Instead of using wealth for everything, the character uses Resources, grouping in a single value connections, favors and money. For that, not all resources are available to the character at same time, money is money, and can be used to buy anything, but its impossible to use the technological background to find a farm in the countryside for a good price, or the best place to buy illegal heavy </div> </div> </div>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/481584/house-rules-bundle-bundle\" target=\"_blank\">House Rules - The Bundle</a> - House Rules for Everyone<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/481581/powered-inspiration-bundle\" target=\"_blank\">Powered Inspired</a> - Powered Characters using Inspiration and Gifts<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/product/413362/Fists-and-Tomes-BUNDLE\" target=\"_blank\">Fists and Tomes</a> - Inspired Martial Arts and Mysticism for Talents<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/492147/supertech\" target=\"_blank\">Supertech</a> - Super Science in the hands of Talents","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24985-mateus-luz","name":"Mateus Luz","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24985_3.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2950"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}